# Gmail SMTP — sends the waitlist welcome email.
# 1. Enable 2-Step Verification on the Gmail account.
# 2. Create an App Password: https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords
# 3. Paste it below (spaces are fine). NEVER commit .env.local.
#
# The app runs and stores signups even without these — email just won't send.
GMAIL_USER="your-address@gmail.com"
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD="xxxx xxxx xxxx xxxx"

# Postgres is fully local & automatic (pgserver — bundled binaries).
# No DATABASE_URL needed; data lives in ./pgdata and is seeded with 50 samples.
